und)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAn interest in making websites that don't look like \u003ca href=\"https://op.tngl.io/every-fucking-website/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ethis\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHave a portfolio we can look at!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA few nice things:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAn interest in space/spaceflight technology\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLikes retrofuturism\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpinionated about fonts\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExperience using Figma is useful but not required.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you know someone or are someone who fits this bill, please comment below with a portfolio link, contact, and some information about who you know/yourself. Thank you!\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"A friend and I intend to start a business in the near future and would love to have a great human designer make us some great human (logo/web) designs. I am a programmer and painter by training but have no talent for graphic design and have no idea where to find great designers. So, I'd love to know if you know of any places to look/any great ones you have experience with.\r\n\r\nWe are primarily searching for help with our logo/branding and design for our launch website. \r\n\r\nA few requirements:\r\n- Be a human person who does not use generative AI in design material.\r\n- Able to work freelance (at least until we have things off the ground)\r\n- An interest in making websites that don't look like [this](https://op.tngl.io/every-fucking-website/)\r\n- Have a portfolio we can look at!\r\n\r\nA few nice things:\r\n- An interest in space/spaceflight technology\r\n- Likes retrofuturism\r\n- Opinionated about fonts\r\n- Experience using Figma is useful but not required.\r\n\r\nIf you know someone or are someone who fits this bill, please comment below with a portfolio link, contact, and some information about who you know/yourself. Thank you!",